DESCRIPTION:<p>For the November second Saturday Explorer ride\, my plan is 
 to follow an approximately 53 mile loop starting in Knights Landing at 9:30
  a.m. that will eventually take us to Dunnigan\, our lunch stop. We will ea
 t at Dunnigan Community Park. Bring your own lunch or plan to purchase food
  at the Zamora mini-mart or the Chevron Station in Dunnigan (sadly\, it see
 ms that the Jack-in-the-Box in Dunnigan has closed). On the way back we mig
 ht see winter water birds along County Line Road and CA-45. Substantial cha
 nce of rain will cancel the ride.<u></u><u></u></p><p>At a minimum\, regrou
 ps will be at the following locations and intersections:<u></u><u></u></p><
 ul><li>Zamora Mini-Mart<u></u><u></u></li><li>Rd 14 and Rd 85<u></u><u></u>
 </li><li>Rd 85 and Rd 8<u></u><u></u></li><li>Chevron at Rd 6 and Rd 89<u><
 /u><u></u></li><li>Rd 89 and County Line Rd<u></u><u></u></li><li>County Li
 ne Rd and CA-45<u></u><u></u></li></ul><p>Please let me know if you need ad
 ditional information or have suggestions for route improvements.</p><br>Rid
 e Description: <a href="https://davisbikeclub.org/2nd-sat-explorer-ride/" t
 arget="_blank">https://davisbikeclub.org/2nd-sat-explorer-ride/</a>
